I Spit on Your Grave: Déjà Vu is a thriller,
horror film directed by Meir Zarchi.

3
00:17:45,599 --> 00:17:51,599
Following her rape, Jennifer Hills wrote a bestselling account of her ordeal and of the controversial trial in
which she was accused of taking the law into her own hands and brutally killing her assailants.

4
