11
01:05:07,199 --> 01:05:13,199
I Spit on Your Grave (originally titled Day of the Woman) is a 1978 American
rape and revenge film written and directed by Meir Zarchi.

12
01:11:02,399 --> 01:11:08,399
The film tells the story of Jennifer Hills (Camille Keaton), a fiction writer based in New York
City who exacts revenge on her four tormentors who gang rape and leave her for dead.

13
01:16:57,599 --> 01:17:03,599
I Spit on Your Grave is noted for its controversial depiction of extreme graphic violence,
particularly the lengthy depictions of gang rape, that take up 30 minutes of its runtime.

14
01:22:52,800 --> 01:22:58,800
During its wider release, it was branded a "video nasty" in the United Kingdom,
and was a target of censorship by film commissioning bodies.

15
01:28:48,000 --> 01:28:54,000
Film critic Roger Ebert became one of the most notable detractors of I
Spit on Your Grave, calling it "a vile bag of garbage".

16
01:34:43,199 --> 01:34:49,199
The film remains highly controversial to this day, even being
considered to be one of the worst films ever made.

17
01:40:38,399 --> 01:40:44,399
For some, it is this controversy which has led to
it being deemed a cult classic.

18
01:46:33,599 --> 01:46:39,599
Despite the controversy and overwhelmingly negative reviews, the
performance of Keaton was praised by critics.

19
01:52:28,800 --> 01:52:34,800
In 2010, I Spit on Your Grave was included in Time
magazine's "Top 10 Ridiculously Violent Movies".

20
01:58:24,000 --> 01:58:30,000
The film spawned a 2010 remake, which has since spawned two sequels of its own: I Spit on
Your Grave 2 (2013), and I Spit on Your Grave III: Vengeance Is Mine (2015).

21
02:04:19,199 --> 02:04:25,199
A direct sequel, I Spit on Your Grave: Deja Vu, was released
in 2019 with Zarchi and Keaton both returning.

22
02:10:14,399 --> 02:10:20,399
In her memoir Inside Out, Demi Moore confirmed that she is the scantily
clad woman on the film's poster with her back turned.

23
02:16:09,599 --> 02:16:15,599
The film explores themes of rape, sequel, revenge, rape and revenge.

24
02:22:04,799 --> 02:22:10,799
The tone is dark and intense.
